# TAP: the plan first, then "ok K - name" / "not ok K - name" as each ends.
# Each test builds its own system tree in a temp folder (_root points there);
# pkgutil, launchctl, codesign, ps, sfltool, brew and file are one stub script
# answering from the test's stub.json and logging each call -- nothing real is
# asked or changed, and the tests run as any user.

